# ⚠️ CAPTURES ARE NOT SOURCE. A 132.5 MB fitted model
# (natVR/captures/model-selection/random-forest-model.joblib) was committed on
# this branch and made it unpushable: GitHub rejects any file over 100 MB, so
# the whole branch — 20 commits of Convention EMG quick-start work — could not
# leave this machine. It was stripped from history on 2026-09-14.
#
# trunk has carried this rule since before the branch was pushed; the branch
# predates it, which is how the file got in. Keeping the two in step here so a
# merge cannot reintroduce the problem.
#
# Fitted models and recorded captures are build artifacts: reproducible from
# training, and belonging in object storage rather than in git.
natVR/captures/
